1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,150
(Leonard:)Please don't tell anyone

2
00:00:01,150 --> 00:00:02,620
(Leonard:)I spent the night
with Raj's sister.

3
00:00:02,620 --> 00:00:04,620
(Sheldon:)There it is.

4
00:00:05,590 --> 00:00:07,490
(Sheldon:)What if someone asks?

5
00:00:07,490 --> 00:00:10,090
No one's going to ask if I spent
the night with Raj's sister.

6
00:00:10,090 --> 00:00:14,200
(Sheldon:)Perhaps, but they might ask me
something else.

7
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:15,530
(Leonard:)Like what?
Like

8
00:00:15,530 --> 00:00:20,050
"Has Leonard betrayed any
of his friends recently?"

9
00:00:20,050 --> 00:00:22,200
(Leonard:)Priya and I are both adults.

10
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:23,910
I didn't betray Raj.

11
00:00:23,910 --> 00:00:27,480
(Sheldon:)In fact, you did,
but I was referring to Howard.

12
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:28,540
(Leonard:)What are you talking about?

13
00:00:28,550 --> 00:00:30,530
April 12, 2005.

14
00:00:30,530 --> 00:00:32,620
(Sheldon:)Bob's Big Boy,
Toluca Lake.

15
00:00:32,620 --> 00:00:36,220
(Sheldon:)Raj had just introduced us
to Priya for the first time.

16
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:39,360
(Sheldon:)She was enjoying the sweet taste
of Hindu rebellion

17
00:00:39,360 --> 00:00:42,120
(Sheldon:)in the form of a Bob's
Super Big Boy hamburger.

18
00:00:42,130 --> 00:00:43,390
(Sheldon:)In order
to preserve

19
00:00:43,390 --> 00:00:46,600
(Sheldon:)your friendship, you and Howard
made a pinky swear

20
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:48,430
(Sheldon:)that neither of you
would attempt to woo her.

21
00:00:49,420 --> 00:00:52,130
(Sheldon:)I had a patty melt.

22
00:00:52,140 --> 00:00:54,000
(Leonard:)Okay, fine, I betrayed Howard.

23
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:55,940
(Sheldon:)And Raj.
All right, and Raj.

24
00:00:55,940 --> 00:00:57,590
(Sheldon:)And me.

25
00:00:57,590 --> 00:00:59,340
(Priya:)You?

26
00:00:59,340 --> 00:01:00,930
(Sheldon:)Violation of the
Roommate Agreement's

